# Copy to .env and fill in real values.  NEVER commit .env.
# Credentials never appear in code -- see CLAUDE.md section 3.3.
#
# EVERY value in this file is a PLACEHOLDER and nothing real belongs here.
# tests/test_env_example.py fails the suite if anything credential-shaped appears:
# a pasted authorisation URL, a credential-bearing query parameter, a JWT, a Fyers
# app-id shape, or a long secret-looking value.
#
# That test exists because a real app id and a pasted authorisation URL were once
# appended to the bottom of this file and sat there unnoticed. A placeholder file is
# only safe if something checks that it stayed one.

# ---- Fyers API v3 -------------------------------------------------------------
# Create an app at https://myapi.fyers.in/dashboard to obtain these three values.
FYERS_APP_ID=YOUR_FYERS_APP_ID
FYERS_SECRET=YOUR_FYERS_SECRET
FYERS_REDIRECT_URI=http://127.0.0.1:8080/callback
# Standard Data Socket plan: 100 symbols per user. After a Prime upgrade, set to 5000.
FYERS_WEBSOCKET_SYMBOL_LIMIT=100

# The redirect URI must match what you registered with Fyers EXACTLY. Nothing in
# this project serves that path: the browser is expected to fail to load it, and you
# paste the URL back by hand. Keep it off port 8000 so it cannot collide with a
# dashboard that is already running. See CLAUDE.md 3.2.
#
# Do NOT paste the resulting authorisation URL, authorisation code, or access token
# into this file. The code is single-use and short-lived; the token is a live
# credential. `python -m src.cli auth` takes them at the prompt and caches the token
# under data/, which is gitignored in full.

# NOTE: there is no TOTP / PIN entry here on purpose. The daily 2FA step is MANUAL
# and stays manual (SEBI requirement + security boundary). Do not add secrets that
# would let anything automate the login.

# ---- Optional overrides -------------------------------------------------------
# ENV=local
# LOG_LEVEL=INFO
# API_HOST=127.0.0.1
# API_PORT=8000

# Flip to true ONLY after reconciling cost rates against real Fyers contract notes.
# COST_RATES_VERIFIED=false

# ALLOW_ORDER_PLACEMENT is intentionally absent. It is hard-wired False and
# validated to reject True. This system is advisory only.
